    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1375">

                <pb facs="1634" n="1436" sameAs="frus:frus1945Berlinv02/pg1436"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">840.811/7–2545</note>
                <head>No. 1375<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Proposal by the British
                        Delegation</hi><anchor n="1" xml:id="d1375-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Extract<anchor n="2" xml:id="d1375-f2"/>]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Babelsberg</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1945-07-27">July 27, 1945</date>.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Draft Proposal by the British
                        Delegation</hi></p>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">International Inland
                        Waterways</hi></p>
                <p rendition="#center">. . . . . . . . . . . . . .</p>
                <p>It was also agreed that the principle of free and unrestricted navigation should
                    be applied to the whole of the Straits between the Black Sea and the Aegean Sea,
                    and that in furtherance of this principle the Montreux Convention of 1936 should
                    be abrogated by the proper regular procedure and replaced by a new international
                    agreement. This agreement would affirm the principle of free and unrestricted
                    navigation of the Straits by warships and merchant ships, in peace and war, and
                    would be guaranteed, for their part, by the Three Powers.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d1375-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d1375-f1-content">
                <p>Submitted at a meeting of the Subcommittee on Inland Waterways, July 27. See <hi
                        rendition="#italic">ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg453">p. 453</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1375-f2" n="2" xml:id="d1375-f2-content">
                <p>For the other paragraphs of this proposal, see <ref target="#d759">document No.
                        759</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
